## Phase 2 Architecture

### 5-Layer Design

```
L5: Energy History Layer
    ├── EnergyPatternDB (energy pattern storage + querying)
    └── EfficiencyLearner (action effectiveness tracking)

L4: Green Consensus Layer
    ├── GreenRaftNode (power-aware Raft)
    ├── PowerLeaderElection (weighted election)
    └── LowPowerReplication (replication optimization)

L3: Predictive PM Layer
    ├── EnergyPredictor (power forecasting)
    └── DemandResponsePlanner (proactive power actions)

L2: Green Scheduler Layer
    ├── DVFSController (dynamic voltage/frequency)
    ├── SleepManager (sleep state transitions)
    └── WorkloadConsolidator (task consolidation)

L1: Power Sensing Layer
    ├── PowerSensor (power measurement)
    ├── PowerPattern (pattern recognition)
    └── BatteryPredictor (runtime forecasting)
```

**Key Innovation**: Bidirectional data flow (L1→L2/L3/L4/L5 forward, L5→L3 learning feedback)

